# terraria (translated client), process A of the multiplayer proof: first run with a save root that holds
# ref_small.wld -> language -> title -> Multiplayer -> Host & Play -> New player "Hoster" -> the world ->
# empty password -> the game starts its dedicated server (this executable with -server) and joins it.
# Then it waits for process B (mp_join.input): the second player, the tile that player digs, that player
# walking away; sends a chat message; waits for B to leave; Save & Exit.
# Run both with: sh crates/terraria-app/scripts/run_multiplayer.sh   (TERRARIA_NET_LOOPBACK_ONLY=1, port 47800)
# `wait S COND` stops this script's clock until the condition holds (the other process decides when).
frame 900 mouse 640 360
# "English" is the first entry of the language list (first run only: no config.json yet)
frame 1010 mouse 640 247
frame 1030 click left
frame 1100 mouse 900 600
frame 1200 dump menu
# title menu: 0 Single Player, 1 Multiplayer
frame 1210 aim menu 1
frame 1230 click left
frame 1290 dump menu
frame 1295 shot ../work/shots/mp_a0_multiplayer_menu.png
# multiplayer menu: 0 Join via IP, 1 Host & Play, 2 Back
frame 1300 aim menu 1
frame 1320 click left
frame 1390 dump ui
# the player list is empty: "New", then "Create" with a typed name
frame 1400 mouse 807 650
frame 1420 click left
frame 1500 mouse 770 533
frame 1520 click left
frame 1590 text Hoster
frame 1630 text \n
frame 1730 dump ui
frame 1740 aim snap Play 0
frame 1760 click left
frame 1830 dump ui
# the world list: ref_small
frame 1840 aim snap Play 0
frame 1860 click left
frame 1930 dump ui
frame 1935 shot ../work/shots/mp_a1_password.png
# the server password prompt: empty, Enter -> Main.HostAndPlay()
frame 1940 text \n
frame 1990 dump net
frame 2000 wait 300 ingame
frame 2060 dump net
frame 2060 dump players
frame 2060 dump world
frame 2070 shot ../work/shots/mp_a2_ingame_alone.png
frame 2080 wait 600 players 2
frame 2140 dump players
frame 2150 shot ../work/shots/mp_a3_two_players.png
# B digs the ground tile two to the right of the spawn (both players stand at the spawn)
frame 2160 dump tile rel 2 2
frame 2170 wait 300 tile rel 2 2 inactive
frame 2180 dump tile rel 2 2
frame 2190 shot ../work/shots/mp_a4_tile_dug_by_b.png
# B walks to the right
frame 2200 wait 300 remote-moved 160
frame 2210 dump players
frame 2260 dump players
frame 2270 shot ../work/shots/mp_a5_b_walked.png
# chat: Enter opens the chat line, the text, Enter sends it
frame 2280 key Enter press
frame 2310 text hello from A
frame 2340 dump chat
# (the game sends on the typed character 13 while the Enter KEY was up in the frame before: Main.DoUpdate_HandleChat)
frame 2350 text \n
frame 2400 dump chat
frame 2410 shot ../work/shots/mp_a6_chat_sent.png
# B leaves
frame 2420 wait 300 players 1
frame 2480 dump players
frame 2480 dump net
# Save & Exit: inventory (Escape), the Settings button, the last entry of the left column
frame 2500 key Escape press
frame 2530 aim settings
frame 2540 click left
frame 2575 shot ../work/shots/mp_a7_settings.png
frame 2580 aim ui 414 517
frame 2590 click left
frame 2600 wait 120 menu
frame 2700 dump net
frame 2710 shot ../work/shots/mp_a8_title_after_exit.png
frame 2760 quit
